# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Things that live in the tree but must not go into the repository
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A venv symlink. `.venv` above catches the directory, not an alias beside it.
# This also covers `.venv-mirrors/`, which the rule above already names.
.venv-*
# Vaults on /share/ju. The symlink points outside the repository, thus a clone
# elsewhere gets a dead link.
downstream-projects-wiki
vault/urban-visual-analytics
# Nested git repositories. Track these as a submodule, or not at all — git adds
# a bare gitlink that no clone can resolve.
sub/
papers/cvpr27_machine-perception-public-spaces/
# Reports that a notebook writes again. `think10k_reasoning_reports.zip` alone
# holds 160 MB.
*.zip
# Map exports and data caches that a notebook writes again.
notebooks/**/cache/
notebooks/**/*_map.html
